  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Clean Minimalism\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Clean Minimalism\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-white flex flex-col font-sans text-slate-900 overflow-hidden border border-slate-200\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Navigation -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 border-bottom border-slate-100 px-8 flex items-center justify-between bg-white shrink-0 shadow-sm\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold\\\">IB</div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-800\\\">Geography Assessment Training Engine</h1>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse\\\"></span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500\\\">Model Training Active</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Workspace -->\\n  <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden bg-slate-50\\\">\\n    <!-- Sidebar: Dataset Inventory -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-72 bg-white border-r border-slate-200 p-6 flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"mb-8\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 block mb-4\\\">Training Queue</label>\\n        <nav class=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"group flex items-center p-3 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-6 h-6 rounded border border-indigo-200 flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-[10px] font-bold text-indigo-600 mr-3\\\">01</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-sm font-medium text-indigo-900\\\">Hydrological Cycles</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"ml-auto text-indigo-500\\\">\342\234\223</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"group flex items-center p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-6 h-6 rounded border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 mr-3\\\">02</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600\\\">Urban Stress Patterns</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"ml-auto text-emerald-500\\\">\342\234\223</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"group flex items-center p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-6 h-6 rounded border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 mr-3\\\">03</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600\\\">GNI & HDI Disparities</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"ml-auto text-emerald-500\\\">\342\234\223</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </nav>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto p-4 bg-slate-900 rounded-xl text-white\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-2\\\">Analysis Status</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n          All training examples processed. Engine calibrated for IB Command Terms: <span class=\\\"text-indigo-400 italic\\\">Discuss, Examine, Evaluate</span>.\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Content Area: Data Preview -->\\n    <main class=\\\"flex-1 p-8 overflow-hidden flex flex-col space-y-6\\\">\\n      <!-- Top Info Card -->\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm flex items-start space-x-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-40 h-40 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200\\\">\\n           <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n             <div class=\\\"text-2xl mb-1\\\">\360\237\223\212</div>\\n             <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase\\\">Infographic 01</div>\\n           </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\\\">Analysis of Global Water Stress (2020-2050)</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\">\\n            The infographic showcases spatial variations in physical vs economic water scarcity. AI has parsed 14 data points, 3 map layers, and the accompanying choropleth legend.\\n          </p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex space-x-4\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-[10px] font-bold rounded uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600\\\">Unit 1: Freshwater</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-[10px] font-bold rounded uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600\\\">HL Extension</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Detailed Breakdown Grid -->\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 min-h-0\\\">\\n        <!-- Left: Questions -->\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\\\">Calibrated Questions</h3>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-6 space-y-6 overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600\\\">[2 Marks]</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm italic text-slate-700\\\">\\\"Identify the region showing the highest projected increase in physical water scarcity between 2025 and 2050 based on Figure 1.\\\"</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600\\\">[6 Marks]</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm italic text-slate-700\\\">\\\"Examine the relationship between GDP per capita and economic water scarcity as depicted in the infographic data.\\\"</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Right: Markscheme -->\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\\\">Logic & Markscheme Calibration</h3>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-6 space-y-4 overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"p-4 bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg border border-emerald-100\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex items-center text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold mb-2\\\">\\n                <span>CRITERIA A: KNOWLEDGE</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"ml-auto\\\">SCORE: OPTIMAL</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs text-emerald-700 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                The engine has recognized the requirement for referencing specific map coordinates and quantitative data (m\302\263/capita/year) in top-tier responses.\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400\\\">CALIBRATED RESPONSE PATHS:</p>\\n              <ul class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2\\\">\\n                <li class=\\\"flex items-start\\\"><span class=\\\"mr-2 text-indigo-500\\\">\342\200\242</span> Synthesis of climate change factors</li>\\n                <li class=\\\"flex items-start\\\"><span class=\\\"mr-2 text-indigo-500\\\">\342\200\242</span> Population density correlation</li>\\n                <li class=\\\"flex items-start\\\"><span class=\\\"mr-2 text-indigo-500\\\">\342\200\242</span> Infrastructural investment impacts</li>\\n              </ul>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </main>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Bottom Bar: User Interaction -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-200 px-8 flex items-center justify-between shrink-0\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium\\\">\\n      Training Engine Version 4.2.0-Alpha \342\200\242 <span class=\\\"text-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">Ready to Proceed</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex space-x-4\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"px-6 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors border border-slate-200\\\">Re-analyze Datasets</button>\\n      <button class=\\\"px-8 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-indigo-600 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all\\\">Submit New Infographic</button>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Clean Minimalism\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Clean Minimalism\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-white flex flex-col font-sans text-slate-900 overflow-hidden border border-slate-200\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Navigation -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-16 border-bottom border-slate-100 px-8 flex items-center justify-between bg-white shrink-0 shadow-sm\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold\\\">IB</div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-800\\\">Geography Assessment Training Engine</h1>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse\\\"></span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500\\\">Model Training Active</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <!-- Main Workspace -->\\n  <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden bg-slate-50\\\">\\n    <!-- Sidebar: Dataset Inventory -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-72 bg-white border-r border-slate-200 p-6 flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"mb-8\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 block mb-4\\\">Training Queue</label>\\n        <nav class=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"group flex items-center p-3 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-6 h-6 rounded border border-indigo-200 flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-[10px] font-bold text-indigo-600 mr-3\\\">01</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-sm font-medium text-indigo-900\\\">Hydrological Cycles</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"ml-auto text-indigo-500\\\">\342\234\223</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"group flex items-center p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-6 h-6 rounded border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 mr-3\\\">02</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600\\\">Urban Stress Patterns</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"ml-auto text-emerald-500\\\">\342\234\223</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"group flex items-center p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-6 h-6 rounded border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 mr-3\\\">03</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600\\\">GNI & HDI Disparities</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"ml-auto text-emerald-500\\\">\342\234\223</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </nav>\\n      </div>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"mt-auto p-4 bg-slate-900 rounded-xl text-white\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mb-2\\\">Analysis Status</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n          All training examples processed. Engine calibrated for IB Command Terms: <span class=\\\"text-indigo-400 italic\\\">Discuss, Examine, Evaluate</span>.\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Content Area: Data Preview -->\\n    <main class=\\\"flex-1 p-8 overflow-hidden flex flex-col space-y-6\\\">\\n      <!-- Top Info Card -->\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm flex items-start space-x-6\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-40 h-40 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200\\\">\\n           <div class=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n             <div class=\\\"text-2xl mb-1\\\">\360\237\223\212</div>\\n             <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase\\\">Infographic 01</div>\\n           </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2\\\">Analysis of Global Water Stress (2020-2050)</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\">\\n            The infographic showcases spatial variations in physical vs economic water scarcity. AI has parsed 14 data points, 3 map layers, and the accompanying choropleth legend.\\n          </p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex space-x-4\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-[10px] font-bold rounded uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600\\\">Unit 1: Freshwater</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 text-[10px] font-bold rounded uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600\\\">HL Extension</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Detailed Breakdown Grid -->\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 min-h-0\\\">\\n        <!-- Left: Questions -->\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\\\">Calibrated Questions</h3>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-6 space-y-6 overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600\\\">[2 Marks]</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm italic text-slate-700\\\">\\\"Identify the region showing the highest projected increase in physical water scarcity between 2025 and 2050 based on Figure 1.\\\"</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600\\\">[6 Marks]</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm italic text-slate-700\\\">\\\"Examine the relationship between GDP per capita and economic water scarcity as depicted in the infographic data.\\\"</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Right: Markscheme -->\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl flex flex-col overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50\\\">\\n            <h3 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\\\">Logic & Markscheme Calibration</h3>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"p-6 space-y-4 overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"p-4 bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg border border-emerald-100\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex items-center text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold mb-2\\\">\\n                <span>CRITERIA A: KNOWLEDGE</span>\\n                <span class=\\\"ml-auto\\\">SCORE: OPTIMAL</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs text-emerald-700 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                The engine has recognized the requirement for referencing specific map coordinates and quantitative data (m\302\263/capita/year) in top-tier responses.\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400\\\">CALIBRATED RESPONSE PATHS:</p>\\n              <ul class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-2\\\">\\n                <li class=\\\"flex items-start\\\"><span class=\\\"mr-2 text-indigo-500\\\">\342\200\242</span> Synthesis of climate change factors</li>\\n                <li class=\\\"flex items-start\\\"><span class=\\\"mr-2 text-indigo-500\\\">\342\200\242</span> Population density correlation</li>\\n                <li class=\\\"flex items-start\\\"><span class=\\\"mr-2 text-indigo-500\\\">\342\200\242</span> Infrastructural investment impacts</li>\\n              </ul>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </main>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Bottom Bar: User Interaction -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-200 px-8 flex items-center justify-between shrink-0\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium\\\">\\n      Training Engine Version 4.2.0-Alpha \342\200\242 <span class=\\\"text-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">Ready to Proceed</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex space-x-4\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"px-6 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors border border-slate-200\\\">Re-analyze Datasets</button>\\n      <button class=\\\"px-8 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-indigo-600 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all\\\">Submit New Infographic</button>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
