        lines {
          text: "      const prompt = `You are an expert IB Diploma Programme (IBDP) Geography Examiner. Your task is to generate realistic, exam-quality IBDP Geography Paper 2 data-response questions based on the uploaded infographic, alongside a separate, independent markscheme."
